{"2725560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Idle Fishing", "steam_appid": 2725560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725560/extras/ccac53aae92bfa9ab817f43c4b57fd73.poster.avif?t=1778002465\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725560/extras/ccac53aae92bfa9ab817f43c4b57fd73.webm?t=1778002465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725560/extras/ccac53aae92bfa9ab817f43c4b57fd73.mp4?t=1778002465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Idle and Active Fishing</strong> - crewmates fish automatically while you're away, or jump in with a skill-based mini-game for bigger rewards.<br></li><li><strong>Offline Progress</strong> - earn silver, ascension gold, seagull rewards, and more while the game is closed. Come back to a full haul.<br></li><li><strong>1200+ In-Game Achievements</strong> - with real stat rewards, not just badges.<br></li><li><strong>Pets</strong> - collect, evolve, and bond with pets that provide powerful passive bonuses. Upgrade star levels and unlock unique abilities.<br></li><li><strong>Hire Crewmates</strong> - recruit crewmates with unique stats and bonus slots that directly multiply your income.<br></li><li><strong>Ascension &amp; Rebirth</strong> - ascend to grow a permanent upgrade tree, then rebirth for a meta-prestige layer with its own shop. The loop goes deep.<br></li><li><strong>Excavation Mini-Game</strong> - dig a tile grid with chisels, shovels, bombs, and scanners to uncover fossils, treasure chests, and timed bonuses in a fully separate economy.<br></li><li><strong>Seagull Events</strong> - catch random seagulls for diverse rewards including currencies, eggs, pet food, temp boosts, and more. Pile up offline, release on return.<br></li><li><strong>11 Unique Fishing Zones</strong> - from Ocean and Swamp to Moon and Mars, each with its own fish pool across 6 rarities to discover and collect.<br></li><li><strong>Fishing Contest</strong> - weekly challenge mode with skill-based levels. Earn medals, climb packs, and claim legendary rewards.<br></li><li><strong>Chest Hunt</strong> - a risk/reward mini-game where streaks build multipliers and gem savers keep you in the game.<br></li><li><strong>31 Buildings</strong> - buy and upgrade a full tier of income generators that scale your passive earnings and offline haul.<br></li><li><strong>Weekly Trader</strong> - spend gold on rotating rare currency deals that change every week.<br></li><li><strong>52 Weekly Holiday Events</strong> - a fresh themed event every week of the year.<br></li><li><strong>Daily Quests</strong> - recurring objectives with chest rewards to keep every session meaningful.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725560/extras/ccac53aae92bfa9ab817f43c4b57fd73.poster.avif?t=1778002465\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725560/extras/ccac53aae92bfa9ab817f43c4b57fd73.webm?t=1778002465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725560/extras/ccac53aae92bfa9ab817f43c4b57fd73.mp4?t=1778002465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Idle and Active Fishing</strong> - crewmates fish automatically while you're away, or jump in with a skill-based mini-game for bigger rewards.<br></li><li><strong>Offline Progress</strong> - earn silver, ascension gold, seagull rewards, and more while the game is closed. Come back to a full haul.<br></li><li><strong>1200+ In-Game Achievements</strong> - with real stat rewards, not just badges.<br></li><li><strong>Pets</strong> - collect, evolve, and bond with pets that provide powerful passive bonuses. Upgrade star levels and unlock unique abilities.<br></li><li><strong>Hire Crewmates</strong> - recruit crewmates with unique stats and bonus slots that directly multiply your income.<br></li><li><strong>Ascension &amp; Rebirth</strong> - ascend to grow a permanent upgrade tree, then rebirth for a meta-prestige layer with its own shop. The loop goes deep.<br></li><li><strong>Excavation Mini-Game</strong> - dig a tile grid with chisels, shovels, bombs, and scanners to uncover fossils, treasure chests, and timed bonuses in a fully separate economy.<br></li><li><strong>Seagull Events</strong> - catch random seagulls for diverse rewards including currencies, eggs, pet food, temp boosts, and more. Pile up offline, release on return.<br></li><li><strong>11 Unique Fishing Zones</strong> - from Ocean and Swamp to Moon and Mars, each with its own fish pool across 6 rarities to discover and collect.<br></li><li><strong>Fishing Contest</strong> - weekly challenge mode with skill-based levels. Earn medals, climb packs, and claim legendary rewards.<br></li><li><strong>Chest Hunt</strong> - a risk/reward mini-game where streaks build multipliers and gem savers keep you in the game.<br></li><li><strong>31 Buildings</strong> - buy and upgrade a full tier of income generators that scale your passive earnings and offline haul.<br></li><li><strong>Weekly Trader</strong> - spend gold on rotating rare currency deals that change every week.<br></li><li><strong>52 Weekly Holiday Events</strong> - a fresh themed event every week of the year.<br></li><li><strong>Daily Quests</strong> - recurring objectives with chest rewards to keep every session meaningful.</li></ul>", "short_descri